Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.91,0:00:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're defenseless now, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And you said I didn't\Nbelong in your tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to take that back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.97,0:01:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you tell him, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.91,0:01:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He just might beat that\Nrich snob after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's doing awesome against Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's become one of the\Ngreatest duelists around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He could have won this whole tournament\Nif it wasn't for Merrick's Shadow Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Winged Dragon of Ra, brain his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows await.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're standing, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If he succeeds in\Nattacking my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lose the duel and\Nmy intimation god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.97,0:01:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy can wipe Marek out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I summon Garefreed the Iron Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and call your attack, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All he had to do was yell attack,\Nand Joey would have won the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But in his heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey knows that he's a great duelist\Nworthy of the Battle City crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's dueling pretty well against Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but he'll have to do better\Nthan that to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, congratulations\Non making one good move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.03,0:02:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a first time for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your pal, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.73,0:02:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be standing over there\Nwith the other geeks cheering
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:03:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,my pathetic heart out for the\Nobvious loser of the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget that I destroyed\Nevery powerful monster in your deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.65,0:03:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.69,0:03:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his crush card,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the only monsters I got left have\Nless than 1,500 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.93,0:03:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I gotta keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let Kaiba get the best of me,\Nhe'll never let me live it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.11,0:03:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I gotta put that punk in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.07,0:03:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yugi. I needed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have a clue, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time I gave you a first-hand look\Nat the difference in our skill levels!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand back, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Blade Knight in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack his swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He just lost half his life\Npoints. One more attack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that, Joey's done.\NHe'll pull through well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:03:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,let's just hope so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.17,0:04:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall place one card\Nface down you have no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting warmed up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I must discover what\Nhappened up here today
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When the two Egyptian gods\Nclashed, something was released.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The force created by these two behemoths\Ncaused my Millennium Rod to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the Pharaoh, he and\NKaiba were shown a vision of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But what did they see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is my Millennium\NItem serving anyone but me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I should control the Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to obey me now! Hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the ancient images that\Nyou showed the Pharaoh and Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be more careful with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.21,0:05:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My move, rich boy. Here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say we try this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon little Wingard in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.77,0:05:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's monster is weaker than Kaiba's,\Nbut he played it in attack mode, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he just broke the most basic\Nrule of winning at duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.91,0:05:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some lame attempt at a strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you judge for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the magic card, Legendary Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster that holds this sword\Ngains 300 attack and defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Great move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:06:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can strengthen your Wingard\Nand take down Kaiba's Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.37,0:06:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, little Wingard, draw\Nyour Legendary Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I activate this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorb spell. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the magic card you\Njust combined with your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.15,0:06:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,wing guard is transferred\Nto my blade knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,making my monster even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole my legendary sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And my attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a third-rate strategy,\NWheeler, just as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You could never defeat a\Nduelist with real talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, next time I'm dueling someone\Nwith talent, I'll remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.15,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.51,0:06:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but\NKaiba's a tough customer. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.35,0:06:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Joey is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at his eyes, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.87,0:06:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey is determined to win\Nthis duel no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over that item.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:07:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You are meddling with forces\Nbeyond your control. Return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going on no one can\Nuse the millennium rod but me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the deal with the\Npuzzle it's glowing i have a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,strange feeling that whatever's\Ncausing this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to go find her. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back, Joey. Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You may think I'm going to\Nattack your pitiful wing guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got other things\Nplanned for you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm afraid they're much worse\Nthan anything you could ever imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn, you amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:08:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic\Ncard enemy controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I drop a thousand life points to\Ntake control of one of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Left, right, A, B.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your puny warrior is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wide open, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to play one of my magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Cough Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and it lowers the level of one of my\Nmonsters, making it easier to summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall summon a monster\Nthat usually requires
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.09,0:08:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,two sacrifices by\Nsacrificing only one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to meet my ultimate beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice your little wing guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to summon this card, I\Nsacrifice my Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I protect myself from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So one attack by my Blue-Eyes\Nand you lose the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have quit\Nwhen you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragon, attack\Nhis life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something and do it fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate this, my\Nscapegoat card. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but your attack\Nfailed, rich boy! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's scapegoat absorbed Kaiba's attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's still got three\Nscapegoats left. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My life points aren't going anywhere\Nas long as these guys are on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they won't be for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Blade Knight, destroy\Nhis second scapegoat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:10:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why did your Blade Knight\Njust gain more attack points?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Blade Knight has a\Nspecial ability, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.47,0:10:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It gains 400 attack points when I\Nhave one card or less in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So now it has a strength of 2,300, and\Nmy Blue Eyes has 3,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to the devastating effect\Nof my all-powerful crush card,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you have no monsters with more than 1,500.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba may be an arrogant jerk,\Nbut the guy does have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I take down two of Kaiba's\Nheavyweights with a deck full of wimps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly what I was hoping for, but I\Nguess it can help guard my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play Battle\NWarrior in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That pathetic monster won't slow me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just see about death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So you left a piece of your\Nmind inside this girl. How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and it's my\Nresponsibility to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that you\Ndon't exist anymore, Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I occupy your body now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, and I've returned\Nto reclaim it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're too weak now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, I'm the real you, and you're\Nnothing but a small piece of my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.55,0:11:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of his accident, I\Nwas able to emerge again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Odeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.89,0:11:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you you were too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's time for me to banish what's left\Nof you into the shadows where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's nowhere\Nleft for you to run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no position to make threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I drove you out once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.19,0:12:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just prolonging\Nyour demise. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.49,0:12:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing without\NObelisk to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end our little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never meddle in my affairs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this at once! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Ishizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.53,0:12:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't concern you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, I could banish you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.59,0:12:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.99,0:13:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not my brother! Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have grown weak, Ishizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop him, but forget me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only Merrick now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I occupy his body, Ishizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for you to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.39,0:13:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to reunite with your\Nfather in eternal darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy this\Nimmensely! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite popular today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this has gone\Nfar enough, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our battle will begin\Nsooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Two great forces are now colliding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:14:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, I don't\Nwant to end this just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be too easy, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have something more fun in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so until then good day when we next
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,meet your power will be mine look
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Tea doing up\Nhere? Is she all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,tea has been through quite\Na bit but she should be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,soon but why would she have\Ncome here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, my brother's good\Nside still lives. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He lives within Taya's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.41,0:14:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon, he could be gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.47,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for my\Nmonsters, and it's my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.17,0:14:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the magic card, card of demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This card marks the beginning\Nof the end for you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:14:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And why's that, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I draw five cards now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But in five turns, I lose my entire hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I plan to destroy\Nyou long before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how are you gonna do that, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make my move,\Nand I'll show you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Kaiser Seahorse in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.21,0:15:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiser Seahorse, attack\Nhis scapegoat. Nah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.89,0:15:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Blade Knight, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for my blue eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.23,0:15:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his battle warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.37,0:15:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Joey doesn't even\Nhave one monster left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he doesn't do something soon,\NKaiba will wipe out his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.77,0:15:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you go ahead and try\Nto get yourself out of this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, you've\Ncome to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:16:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In which case, you'll\Njust give up, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't know me very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.39,0:16:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But Joey Wheeler doesn't quit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when he's up against\Nstuck-up rich punks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, this will all be over\Nsoon enough. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I wipe you out, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be exactly what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate Pot of Greed,\NWhich lets me draw two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope these two\Ncards can help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I activate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Grave Robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.85,0:16:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I can take any magic card\NI want from your graveyard. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.01,0:16:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy Controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the magic card you\Nused against me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You entered a command code and\Ntook control of my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna use a slightly different\Ncommand code than you did, Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:17:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have to pay 1,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Up, left, down, right, A.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now instead of controlling you,\Nmonster, I can destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd keep those eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.65,0:17:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm gonna play\NMonster Reborn. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll bring back a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same one I just\Nsent to your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.53,0:17:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's in some serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, blue-eyes white dragon, attack\Nhis blade knife with white lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret that, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start wrapping things up\Nby playing Hayabusa Knight in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense mode. Then I'll play\Nthis card face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:18:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's gonna end my\Nturn Like that? You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.99,0:18:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the way I took your favorite card from\Nyou It looks good standing here behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.53,0:18:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you made a big mistake\Nby taking my blue eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,away from me Now it's time\Nfor me to end this duel
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unacceptable.\NThere's no way I'll allow a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,third-rate duelist like\NWheeler to use my Blue Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you aware of the special ability\Nof my Kaiser Seahorse, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.39,0:18:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do to activate it\Nis send him to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can summon a light attribute\Nmonster from my hand directly to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice my Kaiser Seahorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I can summon Blue Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we each have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his blue eyes against mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue eyes, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'll let\Nyou control my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.07,0:19:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone needs to chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.25,0:19:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew Kaiba'd get that\Nworked up over one little con?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.11,0:19:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm not through yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.69,0:19:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to welcome my friend\Nback to the field now. With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my blue-eyes white\Ndragon, return to the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.57,0:19:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one with the skills\Nnecessary to wield a blue eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for me to\Nuse my dragon to finish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you off and expose you as\Nthe failure you truly are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no business being here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.31,0:19:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon you'll learn that the hard way!
